'''Anji Yukyuzan''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Rurouni Kenshin Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|Rurouni Kenshin Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 15.7 Update|Version 15.7]].

